    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d1065">

                <pb facs="0712" n="640" sameAs="frus:frus1865p4/pg640"/>

                <head>Consul of Peru</head>
                <dateline>
                    <date ana="#date_undated-inferred-from-volume-rules" calendar="gregorian"
                        notAfter="1865-07-31T23:59:59-05:08" notBefore="1865-04-15T00:00:00-05:08"
                        >undated</date>
                </dateline>
                <p>
                    <hi rendition="#small-caps">Consul</hi>: The virtues of Abraham Lincoln, late
                    President of the United States of America, were so prominent, that the news of
                    his tragic death could not have been received otherwise than with feelings of
                    sincere sorrow.</p>
                <p>His constancy and firmness in bringing to a happy end one of the greatest of
                    rebellions of the civilized world, made his life precious and inestimable to the
                    American nation, which deserves the sympathy of all for this unfortunate
                    event.</p>
                <p>The government and people of Peru will lament this deplorable event, and I am
                    sure will be filled with the same lively sympathy which I now have the honor to
                    express to you, in replying to those words of kindness with which you have
                    honored me in your official communication of yesterday.</p>
                <p>Allow me to offer the affectionate considerations with which I have the honor to
                    be, your humble and obedient servant,</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>MANUEL GENERO CARILLO,</signed>
                    <lb/>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">Peruvian Consul.</hi>
                </closer>
                <postscript>
                    <p>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">A. R. McKee</hi>, Esq., <lb/>
                        <hi rendition="#italic">United States Consul.</hi>
                    </p>
                </postscript>
            </div>
